{
"markdown": "### SafariX\n\nIf you find browsing in Apple's default Safari dull, if you get confused looking for function buttons (for example, searching for a word on a web page but having to go into the share sheet), if you miss vertical tabs, or you simply want a more flexible browsing experience, this is the tweak you must have!\n\nWith SafariX, you can customize Safari to suit you better, and it will surely change the way you use the browser.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
{
