{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- Vertical Tab bar interface for iOS 15+.\n- Customize the tool buttons on the bottom navigation bar.\n- Manage downloaded files into any app you want.\n- Show the full URL of the web pages you are browsing.\n- Move tab groups quickly and more easily.\n- And a few more features.\n- See the images above for more details.",
